{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.20 — home page meta description.

  Bing's SEO report flagged the description as too long: the previous copy ran
  ~180 characters, over Bing's 160 limit, and Google truncates at roughly the
  same point — so the closing clause never appeared in results. All four
  languages are now 142–155 characters, keeping the brand, the two product
  categories and the shipping offer, and dropping the returns clause (which is
  stated on the page itself and in the trust strip).

  A description set under Online Store → Preferences still overrides this.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bj_lang = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first | downcase
  case bj_lang
    when 'en'
      assign bj_desc = 'The official Besjaar webshop: high-pressure showerheads with multiple spray modes, plus shower filters and refills. Free NL shipping from €25.'
    when 'de'
      assign bj_desc = 'Der offizielle Besjaar-Webshop: Duschköpfe mit hohem Druck und mehreren Strahlarten, dazu Duschfilter und Ersatzkartuschen. Versand in NL ab 25 € gratis.'
    when 'fr'
      assign bj_desc = 'La boutique officielle Besjaar : pommeaux de douche haute pression à plusieurs jets, filtres de douche et recharges. Livraison NL offerte dès 25 €.'
    else
      assign bj_desc = 'De officiële webshop van Besjaar: douchekoppen met hoge druk en meerdere sproeistanden, plus douchefilters en navulsets. Gratis verzending in NL vanaf €25.'
  endcase
  echo bj_desc
-%}
